'''Shadow Boxer K''' (シャドウボクサー, ''Shadou Bokusā'', '''Shadow Boxer''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Kang Roo]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]] and [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. She was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

