==Trivia==
*In her English description, the phrase "You are already dead" is a direct reference to the catchphrase of [[wikipedia:Kenshiro|Kenshiro]], the main protagonist of ''[[wikipedia:Fist of the North Star|Fist of the North Star]]''. The Japanese description has a completely different phrase.
*Her gender is confirmed by her description in [[The Battle Cats POP!]]: "'You are already dead': Spits out cheesy lines all the time. I feel sorry for the joey in that always puts up with her."
*The word "to" was added to Shadow Boxer K's description in [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]].
*Before [[Version 6.0 Update|Version 6.0]] gave Shadow Boxer K Multi-Hit, her 4,997 damage landed at 9f.

